          "title": "Type-Checked Compliance: Deterministic Guardrails for Agentic Financial Systems Using Lean 4 Theorem Proving",
          "title_zh": "类型检查式合规：使用 Lean 4 定理证明为智能体金融系统提供确定性护栏",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2604.01483v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "NVIDIA",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2604.01483",
          "summary": "The paper presents the Lean-Agent Protocol, a formal-verification-based guardrail platform that uses Harmonic AI's Aristotle neural-symbolic model to auto-formalize institutional policies into Lean 4 code. Each proposed agent action is treated as a conjecture and permitted only if the Lean 4 kernel proves it satisfies pre-compiled regulatory axioms.",
